{
  "id": "book-29",
  "checkpoint": 13,
  "title": "Reaching the Ridge",
  "summary": "Paul enfrenta o trecho mais íngreme da trilha, alcança o alto da crista rochosa e contempla a vista panorâmica do vale antes de seguir para o acampamento base.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/book-29.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 140,
  "story_en": "The dirt path ends as the terrain becomes steep and rocky. Paul climbs carefully, placing each foot between solid boulders. He grips a sturdy tree root to maintain his balance on the narrow incline.\n\nHis breathing deepens with every upward step, but the cool mountain breeze keeps him focused. Soon, the tree line thins out, and sunlight bursts across the open ridge.\n\nPaul steps onto the wide flat ledge at the summit. He drops his backpack onto the dry ground and looks back toward the south. Below him, the vast valley stretches into the horizon, with the river shining like a silver ribbon in the afternoon sun.\n\nIn the distance, wooden cabins and colorful tents mark the location of the base camp. Smiling with relief, Paul drinks fresh water and feels ready for the final descent.",
